  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Political Leadership Academy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Political Leadership Academy contributes to youth political empowerment in Morocco through a multidimensional approach, which combines three phases: (i) strategic preparation to ensure strong youth candidacies in next elections (representative democracy), (ii) creation and development of volunteering structures for immediate impact on local communities and policy (participative democracy) and (iii) an unprecedented diagnosis-solutions-advocacy study in Morocco that offers a concrete way of bridging youth and political parties. The expected outcome is concrete mutual guarantees and concessions to rebuild trust in the democratic process.</narrative>
  </description>
